  "result": "Perfect! All 70 tests pass. I've added the invoice numbering system:\n\n**`src/numbering.js`** \u2014 New module with `nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)` that:\n- Generates invoice numbers in format `INV-<year>-<counter>`\n- Counter is 4-digit zero-padded (0001, 0002, ..., 9999, 10000, etc.)\n- Resets to 0001 for each new year\n- Finds the highest counter from existing numbers for that year and increments it\n- Handles numbers in any order\n\n**`issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)` in src/invoices.js** \u2014 Issues a draft invoice by:\n- Generating the next invoice number\n- Setting status to 'issued'\n- Preserving all other invoice properties\n- Returning `fail(NOT_DRAFT)` if the invoice isn't in draft status\n- Never mutating the input\n\n**Tests added:**\n- 10 tests for `nextInvoiceNumber` covering year-based resets, counter padding, ordering, edge cases\n- 7 tests for `issueInvoice` covering normal issuance, property preservation, immutability, multi-year scenarios\n\nAll 70 tests pass. \u2705",
